<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47907" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαρσύνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαρρύνω</span></b> , causal of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαρσέω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>encourage, embolden</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάρσυνον</span> (aor. imper.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέ οἱ ἦτορ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.242
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαρσύνεσκε παριστάμενος ἐπέεσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.233
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. μύθῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.190
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. λόγοις</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοβεῖν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				216
			</span></i> (troch.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργῳ καὶ λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.3.27
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.59
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,= 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαρσέω, ἀλλ᾽, ὦ φίλη, θάρσυνε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					916
				</span></i>
			.—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρασύνω</span>.</div>
